WEBVTT

01:49.610 --> 01:54.940
[A Dream Within A Dream]

01:55.050 --> 01:57.970
[Episode 9]

01:58.050 --> 02:01.230
[Qianyu Mansion]

02:04.950 --> 02:05.760
Guihong.

02:08.960 --> 02:10.479
What are you thinking about here

02:10.479 --> 02:11.320
all alone?

02:20.310 --> 02:21.590
Rong Hua and the others are all okay.

02:21.590 --> 02:23.079
They just suffered some
superficial injuries.

02:23.079 --> 02:23.870
Don't worry.

02:23.910 --> 02:24.810
Father will certainly not stand by
and do nothing

02:24.810 --> 02:27.079
about what happened today.

02:28.560 --> 02:29.820
When Aunt passed away,

02:31.240 --> 02:32.900
I thought it was the last time.

02:37.120 --> 02:39.180
When my father died in Pingrong City,

02:39.970 --> 02:41.900
I also thought it was the last time.

02:43.120 --> 02:45.760
I never expected that only after
returning to the capital

02:45.760 --> 02:49.420
would I truly understand how treacherous
people's hearts can be.

02:52.570 --> 02:53.460
Your Highness,

02:54.900 --> 02:56.760
may I entrust you with something?

02:56.910 --> 02:57.560
Look at you.

02:57.560 --> 02:59.560
There's no need for such formalities
between us, okay?

02:59.560 --> 03:00.190
Go ahead.

03:00.730 --> 03:02.000
I want to go to the Ministry of Rites
and look through

03:02.000 --> 03:04.460
the records of previous Lantern Festivals.

03:04.710 --> 03:07.310
Nan Heng doesn't want me
to stay in the capital?

03:07.520 --> 03:08.310
Fine.

03:08.870 --> 03:10.060
Let's see

03:10.910 --> 03:12.440
who'll have the last laugh.

03:13.280 --> 03:14.080
Good.

03:14.240 --> 03:15.030
Guihong.

03:15.080 --> 03:17.240
Now that you've said that, I
feel relieved.

03:17.240 --> 03:19.360
As long as we two cousins are united,

03:19.360 --> 03:20.870
we can overcome any obstacle.

03:20.870 --> 03:22.680
Even if there were 10, or even
100 Nan Hengs,

03:22.680 --> 03:24.579
they still wouldn't be a match for us.

03:24.579 --> 03:25.380
Right?

03:28.240 --> 03:29.030
Here.

03:33.850 --> 03:35.060
Why does this wine taste like that?

03:35.060 --> 03:38.320
It can't hold a candle to the wine of
Waning River Crescent.

03:39.120 --> 03:39.910
General.

03:39.910 --> 03:40.770
Your Highness.

03:41.470 --> 03:42.240
Why are you here

03:42.240 --> 03:44.700
instead of resting and
healing your injury?

03:44.910 --> 03:45.840
Look over there.

03:51.400 --> 03:52.310
What's this?

03:53.920 --> 03:56.420
These are fireworks specially made by
foreign merchants.

03:56.420 --> 03:59.300
I guarantee you've never seen anything
like this before.

03:59.300 --> 04:00.110
General.

04:00.490 --> 04:01.810
We've decided.

04:01.870 --> 04:03.400
For this year's Lantern Festival
blessings,

04:03.400 --> 04:05.490
the Qianyu Army will present the people

04:05.490 --> 04:07.470
with an unprecedented fireworks display.

04:07.470 --> 04:08.630
To let them know

04:08.630 --> 04:10.930
that our Qianyu Army is like a dragon
on the battlefield,

04:10.930 --> 04:12.150
and while stationed in the capital,

04:12.150 --> 04:13.680
we are still fierce tigers.

04:16.720 --> 04:17.510
Go ahead.

04:18.430 --> 04:20.000
What wise opinions do you have, gentlemen?

04:20.000 --> 04:20.970
Your Highness.

04:21.160 --> 04:22.430
I've said it before,

04:22.430 --> 04:23.310
this Song Yimeng

04:23.310 --> 04:24.600
is full of evil intentions

04:24.600 --> 04:26.200
and cannot be trusted at all.

04:26.430 --> 04:27.240
As for Mr. Shangguan,

04:27.240 --> 04:28.680
he's stubborn and self-opinionated.

04:28.680 --> 04:31.070
Due to his own dark and
despicable thoughts,

04:31.070 --> 04:33.240
he came up with those useless suggestions,

04:33.240 --> 04:35.010
leading to this situation.

04:35.800 --> 04:36.630
I suggest

04:36.630 --> 04:37.920
punishing Mr. Shangguan

04:37.920 --> 04:39.270
and keeping him away from Your Highness.

04:39.270 --> 04:40.070
Fugui.

04:40.360 --> 04:41.720
We've been colleagues for three years
after all.

04:41.720 --> 04:43.630
That's not an appropriate thing
to say, is it?

04:43.630 --> 04:46.159
At least I can help Chief Master
solve his troubles.

04:46.159 --> 04:47.820
What can you do for His Highness?

04:47.820 --> 04:49.560
As his personal informant

04:49.560 --> 04:50.510
and most trusted attendant,

04:50.510 --> 04:52.310
you even failed to find out
that Chancellor Gao

04:52.310 --> 04:53.720
had secretly buried explosives.

04:53.720 --> 04:55.000
What use are you to His Highness?

04:55.000 --> 04:56.860
Can you two say something useful?

04:57.159 --> 04:58.620
What good are you two to me?

05:02.510 --> 05:04.120
But this Chancellor Gao actually dared

05:04.120 --> 05:06.750
to make decisions behind my back
without permission.

05:06.750 --> 05:07.630
If it weren't for Mother,

05:07.630 --> 05:09.760
I would have taken care of him long ago.

05:11.170 --> 05:12.430
If you ask me, Your Highness,

05:12.430 --> 05:14.610
you need not worry about this matter.

05:14.920 --> 05:16.750
The fact that Song Yimeng acts this way

05:16.750 --> 05:17.600
precisely indicates

05:17.600 --> 05:19.000
that she has no suspicion

05:19.190 --> 05:21.050
about Your Highness's identity.

05:23.750 --> 05:24.950
I actually think

05:25.000 --> 05:27.310
we could write her a letter in
Li Shiliu's name,

05:27.310 --> 05:29.910
asking her to come see you
with a detailed plan.

05:34.390 --> 05:35.320
That would work.

05:35.680 --> 05:37.680
Doesn't Song Yimeng want to kill me?

05:38.290 --> 05:39.650
Well, I'd like to see

05:40.390 --> 05:42.040
if she has what it takes.

05:43.120 --> 05:46.340
[Three days later]

05:46.830 --> 05:47.630
My Lady.

05:47.800 --> 05:48.600
My Lady.

05:48.810 --> 05:50.540
At least have some breakfast.

05:50.630 --> 05:52.000
I don't have time for that.

05:52.000 --> 05:53.390
Today is a big day for me,

05:53.390 --> 05:54.860
the day I conquer my fate.

05:54.890 --> 05:56.159
If I succeed, I no longer have to
struggle anymore.

05:56.159 --> 05:58.240
If I fail, I might have to
lie low underground.

05:58.240 --> 05:59.040
Yimeng.

05:59.800 --> 06:00.480
General Chu.

06:00.480 --> 06:01.390
Where are you going, Yimeng?

06:01.390 --> 06:02.630
Why are you in such a hurry?

06:02.630 --> 06:04.030
I'm on my way to see Mr. Li.

06:04.550 --> 06:06.210
You're going to see Li Shiliu?

07:12.920 --> 07:14.650
How come you got here before me?

07:24.020 --> 07:25.830
Can anyone explain to me

07:26.610 --> 07:28.080
what's going on here?

07:28.830 --> 07:30.750
Why don't you explain to us, General Chu,

07:30.750 --> 07:32.040
why you're dressed

07:32.430 --> 07:33.760
so flamboyantly today?

07:34.730 --> 07:36.570
You're not looking too shabby yourself.

07:36.570 --> 07:38.300
You keep changing your clothes

07:38.510 --> 07:40.440
and even have gold threads sewn in,

07:42.990 --> 07:44.340
but what's the point?

07:45.140 --> 07:48.430
My Waning River Crescent deals in
a wide variety of businesses.

07:48.430 --> 07:50.680
As the owner of the
Waning River Crescent's Hall,

07:50.680 --> 07:52.040
changing outfits frequently

07:52.040 --> 07:53.240
is not strange at all.

07:54.390 --> 07:55.310
Alright, alright.

07:55.310 --> 07:56.430
Can you two stop

07:56.430 --> 07:58.310
being at each other's throats
every time you meet?

07:58.310 --> 07:59.510
You're both men.

07:59.510 --> 08:01.170
Be a little more open-minded,

08:01.600 --> 08:02.390
okay?

08:02.950 --> 08:03.750
Okay?

08:05.160 --> 08:07.070
Yimeng likes humble people.

08:08.830 --> 08:10.360
This has nothing to do with what I like...

08:10.360 --> 08:11.360
So surely she wouldn't like

08:11.360 --> 08:12.750
someone who shows up uninvited.

08:12.750 --> 08:13.510
Mr. Li...

08:13.510 --> 08:15.800
My fiancée is meeting with a stranger
of unknown origin.

08:15.800 --> 08:16.730
If I didn't come,

08:16.750 --> 08:17.720
how could I be at ease?

08:17.720 --> 08:18.720
If there's no basic trust

08:18.720 --> 08:20.270
between two people,

08:20.270 --> 08:21.360
even if they get married,

08:21.360 --> 08:22.270
they'll be a resentful couple.

08:22.270 --> 08:24.390
You're overstepping your bounds,
don't you think?

08:24.390 --> 08:25.310
You're my defeated foe,

08:25.310 --> 08:26.830
yet you still dare to speak so boldly?

08:26.830 --> 08:27.630
Stop!

08:29.430 --> 08:30.430
Have you two

08:30.830 --> 08:32.630
forgotten why we're here today?

08:33.080 --> 08:35.010
For the assassination of Nan Heng.

08:35.510 --> 08:37.039
If anything goes wrong,

08:37.150 --> 08:38.549
not to mention the three of us,

08:38.549 --> 08:39.480
even the Song family,

08:39.480 --> 08:40.409
the Qianyu Army,

08:40.630 --> 08:41.690
and the Nightwalkers

08:41.690 --> 08:42.870
will all have to die.

08:44.270 --> 08:45.630
It's one thing that you two

08:45.630 --> 08:47.790
dress up so flashily every day,

08:48.080 --> 08:49.870
but can you focus a bit
on the task at hand?

08:49.870 --> 08:50.670
Can you?

08:55.000 --> 08:55.790
Alright,

08:56.080 --> 08:57.550
let's get down to business.

08:57.550 --> 08:58.360
Next,

08:58.870 --> 09:00.930
let's have a proper discussion about

09:05.960 --> 09:09.450
[Grace & Elegance]

09:18.150 --> 09:19.810
the plan to assassinate Heng.

09:27.870 --> 09:28.830
Nan Heng.

09:30.320 --> 09:31.870
I know this guy far too well.

09:34.030 --> 09:35.360
This person

09:35.630 --> 09:36.870
is meticulous,

09:37.050 --> 09:38.720
but also quite distrustful.

09:39.030 --> 09:39.920
Therefore,

09:40.000 --> 09:42.000
if we want to kill him in one strike,

09:42.250 --> 09:45.110
we absolutely cannot let any information
leak out.

09:46.510 --> 09:47.730
The first step

09:47.910 --> 09:50.590
is to lure him away from the protection
of the Xuanjia Army

09:50.590 --> 09:53.450
and take him to the place we've
prepared in advance.

09:55.390 --> 09:56.850
Well, as for the location,

09:56.870 --> 09:58.320
I suggest the Jade River.

09:59.850 --> 10:00.970
The Jade River

10:01.320 --> 10:02.480
runs through the city,

10:02.480 --> 10:03.660
which is densely populated.

10:03.660 --> 10:05.520
Even if the assassination fails,

10:05.600 --> 10:07.080
we can blend into the crowd

10:07.100 --> 10:08.220
and escape smoothly.

10:08.010 --> 10:09.230
[Plan to Assassinate Heng]

10:11.340 --> 10:12.310
When it comes to assassination,

10:12.310 --> 10:14.110
Mr. Li, you're indeed an expert.

10:17.130 --> 10:19.060
As for luring Nan Heng away,

10:19.080 --> 10:20.320
I'll take care of it.

10:20.550 --> 10:21.900
When the time comes, I can say

10:21.900 --> 10:23.640
that I have news about
the method of weapon forging,

10:23.640 --> 10:25.090
and I can invite him over for a chat.

10:25.090 --> 10:26.570
I'm sure he'll agree.

10:27.870 --> 10:30.650
As for you, Chu Guihong...

10:31.160 --> 10:33.930
I can have the Qianyu Army hold off
the Xuanjia Army,

10:33.930 --> 10:35.930
ensuring no one comes to his rescue.

10:36.070 --> 10:37.120
Excellent.

10:39.900 --> 10:41.440
Now we're moving on to

10:41.440 --> 10:42.920
the most crucial part:

10:44.190 --> 10:46.360
how to execute the assassination.

11:23.630 --> 11:26.360
Bravo! Bravo!

11:26.380 --> 11:29.200
Bravo! Bravo!

11:30.510 --> 11:31.630
Who's that courtesan?

11:31.630 --> 11:32.760
She's so beautiful.

11:32.790 --> 11:34.870
That's the eldest daughter of
the Song family.

11:34.870 --> 11:36.330
Look how beautiful she is.

11:38.840 --> 11:41.510
Bravo! Bravo!

11:41.540 --> 11:44.960
Bravo! Bravo!

11:45.510 --> 11:46.640
She's looking at me.

11:51.790 --> 11:55.440
Bravo! Bravo!

12:18.130 --> 12:21.270
[Peace & Prosperity]

12:48.670 --> 12:50.280
You're here, Your Highness.

12:59.260 --> 13:00.190
Careful, woman.

13:00.800 --> 13:02.660
You're playing a dangerous game.

13:05.470 --> 13:08.070
Didn't you say you have the
method of weapon forging to share?

13:08.070 --> 13:09.600
Why did you

13:11.000 --> 13:12.200
put on such a show?

13:13.690 --> 13:14.920
It wouldn't be any fun

13:15.360 --> 13:16.960
if I just told you.

13:17.870 --> 13:18.990
But

13:19.240 --> 13:20.970
before we get down to business,

13:22.930 --> 13:25.090
Your Highness,

13:25.960 --> 13:27.890
I want to do something interesting

13:28.540 --> 13:29.910
with you first.

13:32.990 --> 13:34.620
You little demon.

13:35.100 --> 13:36.630
Are you trying to kill me?

13:41.600 --> 13:42.540
Your Highness.

13:42.690 --> 13:43.990
There's no rush.

13:45.300 --> 13:46.870
There are too many people around.

13:46.870 --> 13:48.330
It's not very convenient.

13:58.990 --> 14:00.090
I object!

14:05.000 --> 14:05.970
Bro.

14:06.670 --> 14:09.010
I was just getting into character.

14:09.700 --> 14:10.510
Yimeng,

14:10.530 --> 14:11.870
I think this plan is inappropriate.

14:11.870 --> 14:12.600
You...

14:14.480 --> 14:15.270
He...

14:16.790 --> 14:17.600
I...

14:19.030 --> 14:20.010
In short,

14:20.040 --> 14:21.500
this absolutely won't do.

14:22.050 --> 14:23.710
What exactly is wrong with it?

14:24.420 --> 14:26.030
Do you think my performance just now

14:26.030 --> 14:26.910
was too exaggerated?

14:26.910 --> 14:28.310
Then let me do another take.

14:28.310 --> 14:29.440
I'll do a cute version.

14:29.440 --> 14:30.550
That won't be necessary.

14:30.550 --> 14:31.360
Yimeng.

14:31.510 --> 14:32.600
You don't know men.

14:32.600 --> 14:34.460
Men aren't as simple as you think.

14:34.610 --> 14:36.980
Especially a despicable man like Nan Heng.

14:36.980 --> 14:38.600
What if his intentions are impure,

14:38.600 --> 14:39.510
and he does something improper to you

14:39.510 --> 14:41.390
before you can make your move?

14:41.390 --> 14:41.750
What if he...

14:41.750 --> 14:43.680
Chu Guihong, don't be ridiculous.

14:43.750 --> 14:45.200
Who do you think Nan Heng is?

14:45.200 --> 14:46.360
He's a prince of the current dynasty.

14:46.360 --> 14:47.550
He's seen all kinds of women.

14:47.550 --> 14:49.390
In your eyes, is he just a lust-driven
scoundrel

14:49.390 --> 14:50.150
who loses his mind at the sight of beauty,

14:50.150 --> 14:51.030
and can't move an inch

14:51.030 --> 14:52.890
when he sees a young girl dancing?

14:53.900 --> 14:55.400
Aren't all men like that?

14:56.360 --> 14:57.650
They're all like that.

15:00.220 --> 15:01.400
Yimeng.

15:01.680 --> 15:02.750
I'm not like that.

15:05.880 --> 15:06.910
Anyway,

15:06.940 --> 15:09.030
regardless of whether Nan Heng is
a scoundrel or not,

15:09.030 --> 15:10.910
I absolutely cannot let you put yourself
in danger, Yimeng.

15:10.910 --> 15:11.750
This assassination

15:11.750 --> 15:12.790
is fraught with danger.

15:12.790 --> 15:14.150
I think we should call it off for now,

15:14.150 --> 15:15.120
figure out some other way,

15:15.120 --> 15:15.870
and think it through further.

15:15.870 --> 15:18.210
What's there to think through?

15:18.270 --> 15:19.750
Count on your fingers and see

15:19.750 --> 15:22.550
how many days are left until
the Lantern Festival.

15:33.150 --> 15:35.080
What's with that look you gave him?

15:35.360 --> 15:36.720
At this point,

15:36.720 --> 15:38.580
how can you still not trust Mr. Li?

15:39.150 --> 15:39.960
Yimeng.

15:40.360 --> 15:41.390
You've misunderstood.

15:41.390 --> 15:44.120
-It's not that I don't trust him.
-Am I deaf to you?

15:52.750 --> 15:53.940
Now,

15:54.440 --> 15:56.270
let's have General Chu tell us

15:57.670 --> 15:59.240
how you intend to assassinate him.

15:59.240 --> 15:59.670
I...

16:00.000 --> 16:01.000
Go ahead, tell us.

16:06.360 --> 16:08.440
I've known Nan Heng for many years.

16:09.360 --> 16:11.360
I've always known him to be
treacherous and cunning,

16:11.360 --> 16:13.090
and full of schemes and tricks.

16:13.480 --> 16:14.540
As the saying goes,

16:14.910 --> 16:16.550
"all warfare is based on deception."

16:16.550 --> 16:17.750
Too much calculation

16:17.790 --> 16:19.650
can be easily seen through by him.

16:20.000 --> 16:21.400
If we really want to do it,

16:23.510 --> 16:26.440
perhaps we should do the opposite
of what he expects.

16:26.750 --> 16:29.480
Sunflower seeds! Get your sunflower
seeds here!

16:29.840 --> 16:30.750
Steamed buns!

16:32.390 --> 16:34.850
Fresh steamed buns, just out of
the steamer!

16:35.030 --> 16:36.390
Calligraphy and paintings for sale!

16:36.390 --> 16:38.200
Fine calligraphy and paintings!

16:38.200 --> 16:39.150
Fugui.

16:40.200 --> 16:42.520
When did the capital become so crowded?

16:43.910 --> 16:44.720
Understood!

16:47.360 --> 16:49.320
The Seventh Prince is passing through!

16:49.320 --> 16:51.910
All unauthorized personnel,
clear out immediately!

16:51.910 --> 16:53.480
Go away, all of you!

16:53.480 --> 16:54.120
Move it, move it!

16:54.120 --> 16:55.030
Stand aside!

16:55.030 --> 16:55.440
Get out of the way!

16:55.440 --> 16:56.240
Move quickly!

16:59.870 --> 17:02.200
Is this to Your Highness's satisfaction?

17:05.589 --> 17:06.400
Please.

17:20.030 --> 17:21.359
Move along, move along!

17:30.130 --> 17:31.950
[Qianyu Moon-Cleaving Blade,
Expanded Version]

17:36.850 --> 17:37.770
It's you.

17:38.270 --> 17:39.440
All the past grudges

17:39.960 --> 17:41.440
will be settled today.

17:43.030 --> 17:44.060
Nan Heng.

17:44.680 --> 17:46.270
I'm sorry that I have to kill you.

17:46.270 --> 17:47.310
But tonight,

17:48.520 --> 17:49.770
your life

17:50.240 --> 17:51.510
is mine to take.

17:51.530 --> 17:52.600
Protect me!

18:10.090 --> 18:11.170
Fugui!

18:18.270 --> 18:19.640
No, no, don't kill me!

18:19.660 --> 18:20.880
I'll give you anything you want.

18:20.880 --> 18:22.550
Don't kill me, don't kill me.

18:22.790 --> 18:23.960
I'll give you anything you want!

18:23.960 --> 18:25.960
Don't kill me, please don't kill me!

18:30.160 --> 18:31.240
Enough!

18:33.270 --> 18:34.890
So in your hearts, Nan Heng

18:35.030 --> 18:36.290
is this kind of person?

18:38.310 --> 18:39.350
Is there a problem?

18:39.350 --> 18:40.480
What do you think?

18:41.590 --> 18:42.640
Know your enemy and know yourself,

18:42.640 --> 18:44.240
and you can fight 100 battles
without defeat.

18:44.240 --> 18:45.550
If he's really as you say,

18:45.550 --> 18:47.160
a coward who fears death,

18:48.030 --> 18:50.360
how has he survived in the court
until now?

18:52.720 --> 18:54.790
You wouldn't understand even if
I told you.

18:54.790 --> 18:55.830
He's the male lead.

18:55.830 --> 18:57.030
He can escape from death

18:57.030 --> 18:58.510
and turn misfortune into fortune.

18:58.510 --> 18:59.960
He has a cheat code.

19:00.200 --> 19:01.930
What do you mean by "male lead?"

19:03.770 --> 19:05.010
How should I put it?

19:08.680 --> 19:09.750
Let me explain it this way...

19:09.750 --> 19:10.510
Alright,

19:10.890 --> 19:12.270
are we going to kill him or not?

19:12.270 --> 19:14.270
If we're going to do it, listen to me.

19:16.440 --> 19:18.300
What brilliant ideas do you have?

19:20.740 --> 19:21.750
Haven't you always thought

19:21.750 --> 19:23.750
I had some connection with Nan Heng?

19:23.750 --> 19:25.680
Will you really listen to my ideas?

19:37.500 --> 19:41.620
[Relay & Receive]

19:42.720 --> 19:43.650
Here's the plan.

19:43.880 --> 19:45.610
The location of assassination

19:45.640 --> 19:47.570
will still be set at the Jade River.

19:48.440 --> 19:50.110
When the time comes, your Qianyu Army

19:50.110 --> 19:52.480
will be responsible for
patrolling the capital.

19:52.480 --> 19:54.960
To prevent accidents during
the Lantern Festival,

19:54.960 --> 19:58.220
the Xuanjia Army will surely be sent
to support the palace.

19:58.350 --> 19:59.160
By then,

19:59.400 --> 20:01.000
Nan Heng's entourage during outings

20:01.000 --> 20:02.530
will definitely be sparse.

20:04.720 --> 20:06.030
And then, Miss Song,

20:06.240 --> 20:07.680
just find any excuse

20:07.960 --> 20:09.030
to lure Nan Heng

20:09.510 --> 20:11.310
onto a leisure boat in the river.

20:13.860 --> 20:15.560
Bravo! Bravo!

20:15.750 --> 20:16.590
One more!

20:16.590 --> 20:18.070
Bravo! Bravo!

20:18.640 --> 20:19.500
Your Highness,

20:19.560 --> 20:21.360
you really can hold your liquor.

20:21.750 --> 20:23.240
Bravo!

20:24.510 --> 20:26.000
Bravo!

20:26.020 --> 20:27.080
-Cheers.
-Cheers.

21:36.660 --> 21:37.770
Who are you?

21:41.720 --> 21:44.380
The one who's sending you on
your final journey.

21:45.000 --> 21:47.720
♪ I offer up my vow, wishing to tread
through waves of good and evil ♪

21:48.700 --> 21:51.050
♪ With one heart, side by side,
facing the ups and downs ♪

21:52.180 --> 21:55.090
♪ Gazing toward the end of the eternal
night, suddenly the sky ignites ♪

21:56.370 --> 21:58.700
♪ Do not blame my reckless gaze
at the heavens ♪

21:59.770 --> 22:03.050
♪ I offer up my vow, wishing to embrace
countless hardships upon my soul ♪

22:04.440 --> 22:06.270
♪ With my own body, I vow not
to live in vain ♪

22:07.480 --> 22:10.900
♪ Resolutely choosing to break through
all the myriad phenomena ♪

22:11.710 --> 22:17.350
♪ When I suddenly look back,
calling out, all is well ♪

22:17.640 --> 22:19.740
I don't know how this happened.

22:20.630 --> 22:23.160
The Seventh Prince was such a nice person.

22:23.510 --> 22:26.640
Who on earth would bear a grudge
against him?

22:26.680 --> 22:28.550
I feel so terrible.

22:29.580 --> 22:30.550
Miss Song.

22:30.740 --> 22:31.710
My condolences.

22:32.870 --> 22:34.410
No one wants

22:34.880 --> 22:36.480
this kind of thing to happen.

22:40.920 --> 22:41.680
Disperse. Disperse.

22:41.680 --> 22:43.080
I feel so bad.

22:43.110 --> 22:43.960
Disperse.

22:57.040 --> 22:57.920
Brilliant.

22:59.090 --> 23:00.500
It's truly brilliant.

23:02.300 --> 23:03.850
This plan is excellent.

23:04.030 --> 23:05.960
From execution to aftermath,

23:05.980 --> 23:08.180
everything has been thought out for us.

23:08.510 --> 23:10.310
As expected, working with Mr. Li

23:10.510 --> 23:11.970
brings much peace of mind.

23:13.070 --> 23:14.680
Your knowledge of Nan Heng

23:14.750 --> 23:18.070
and the defenses of the city and even
the palace is quite impressive.

23:18.070 --> 23:20.200
It truly makes me see you in a new light.

23:20.730 --> 23:21.880
If I didn't know better,

23:21.880 --> 23:24.440
I'd think you had held a position
in the court.

23:25.510 --> 23:26.850
If I didn't know much,

23:27.440 --> 23:29.970
how could I manage the
Waning River Crescent?

23:33.240 --> 23:34.210
Anyway,

23:34.240 --> 23:35.830
with Mr. Li's help,

23:35.830 --> 23:38.490
our chances of success have
greatly increased.

23:39.640 --> 23:41.550
As long as Nan Heng dies,

23:42.030 --> 23:43.410
all our troubles

23:43.550 --> 23:45.680
will finally be resolved.

23:45.780 --> 23:46.570
Come on.

23:57.590 --> 23:59.240
The plan to assassinate Heng

23:59.270 --> 24:00.990
officially begins.

24:08.920 --> 24:10.030
Bye-bye, Mr. Li.

24:10.350 --> 24:11.160
Bye-bye.

24:28.040 --> 24:29.110
To have our Chief Master

24:29.110 --> 24:31.370
put on an act for an entire day,

24:31.850 --> 24:33.290
it has to be Miss Song.

24:34.480 --> 24:35.280
What's wrong?

24:35.550 --> 24:36.830
Why aren't you saying anything?

24:36.830 --> 24:38.440
Silence means consent.

24:38.640 --> 24:39.440
Consent

24:40.320 --> 24:42.160
means accepting this love.

24:44.240 --> 24:45.100
Talk business.

24:46.590 --> 24:48.200
The metallurgy room is ready,

24:48.200 --> 24:49.860
waiting for your inspection.

24:53.400 --> 24:54.860
Don't stand too close to me

24:55.590 --> 24:57.250
when you talk to me from now on.

24:58.290 --> 25:00.820
You shouldn't hit so hard from
now on, either.

25:07.240 --> 25:10.700
Will it work, melting half of the
Qianyu Moon-Cleaving Blade?

25:10.910 --> 25:12.430
We'll know once we try.

26:00.230 --> 26:01.670
Why is it so brittle?

26:02.310 --> 26:04.170
Our blades are still not up to par.

26:04.650 --> 26:06.900
After years of studying
the method of weapon forging,

26:06.900 --> 26:08.430
there's still no progress.

26:08.450 --> 26:09.400
How about we invite

26:09.400 --> 26:11.730
some metallurgists from Jiangnan again?

26:11.780 --> 26:15.180
Haven't we brought in plenty of masters
these past few years?

26:15.440 --> 26:16.970
Without the proper method,

26:17.350 --> 26:18.160
it seems

26:18.180 --> 26:19.540
we still can't succeed.

26:23.560 --> 26:27.290
What about sending someone to infiltrate
the military camp again?

26:27.430 --> 26:28.600
No need.

26:28.960 --> 26:30.640
The only person who knows
the method of weapon forging now

26:30.640 --> 26:31.720
is Chu Guihong.

26:32.040 --> 26:34.370
Let's discuss this matter further later.

26:42.570 --> 26:43.370
By the way,

26:44.330 --> 26:45.760
about the assassination,

26:45.760 --> 26:48.490
is it still going according to
the original plan?

26:50.330 --> 26:52.750
Everything will proceed according to
the original plan,

26:52.750 --> 26:54.160
but not entirely.

26:55.500 --> 26:57.210
You might as well have said nothing.

26:57.210 --> 26:58.870
What's that supposed to mean?

27:11.190 --> 27:12.550
You just asked me

27:12.550 --> 27:14.100
not to stand so close when talking to you.

27:14.100 --> 27:15.160
Cut the crap.

27:23.960 --> 27:25.490
Are you kidding me?

27:25.550 --> 27:26.480
How can this possibly work?

27:26.480 --> 27:27.550
Don't worry.

27:27.750 --> 27:28.950
It's almost certain.

27:29.400 --> 27:29.960
But I...

27:29.960 --> 27:32.120
Now Chu Guihong is extremely
cautious of me.

27:32.120 --> 27:34.050
If we don't take drastic measures,

27:35.640 --> 27:36.880
I'm afraid it's difficult to
completely dispel

27:36.880 --> 27:38.680
his suspicions about Li Shiliu.

27:52.790 --> 27:53.590
What's wrong?

27:53.890 --> 27:55.490
Why do you look so troubled?

27:57.680 --> 27:58.480
Yimeng.

27:59.640 --> 28:01.330
Actually, what I said in the hall today

28:01.330 --> 28:02.340
wasn't sincere.

28:03.920 --> 28:05.630
I've had doubts about Li Shiliu

28:05.630 --> 28:07.280
since our first encounter.

28:07.570 --> 28:09.870
Today, when we discussed the
plan to assassinate Heng together,

28:09.870 --> 28:11.440
he actually knew every detail

28:11.440 --> 28:13.040
about Nan Heng's situation.

28:14.200 --> 28:15.360
Don't you find all this

28:15.360 --> 28:16.880
very fishy?

28:17.830 --> 28:19.590
So you've been putting on

28:19.620 --> 28:21.160
an act all day long?

28:23.360 --> 28:24.520
Come on.

28:24.830 --> 28:26.550
People from the Great Jing shouldn't
lie to each other,

28:26.550 --> 28:27.610
okay, bro?

28:27.790 --> 28:28.310
You...

28:28.310 --> 28:28.960
Fine.

28:29.020 --> 28:31.160
Even if all of these are mere
coincidences,

28:31.160 --> 28:32.740
assassinating the
current prince—

28:32.740 --> 28:34.000
the lightest sentence is imprisonment,

28:34.000 --> 28:35.110
and the worst is execution

28:35.110 --> 28:36.110
and implication of the entire family.

28:36.110 --> 28:37.640
Why would he agree to join
the assassination

28:37.640 --> 28:38.790
after just a few brief encounters?

28:38.790 --> 28:39.400
Wrong.

28:39.760 --> 28:41.790
Not only did he not immediately
agree to my proposal,

28:41.790 --> 28:42.880
but he also repeatedly

28:42.880 --> 28:44.200
turned it down.

28:44.920 --> 28:45.960
So what?

28:46.070 --> 28:48.440
Perhaps it's all just a ploy to
gain your trust.

28:48.440 --> 28:49.490
Or maybe

28:49.590 --> 28:52.850
he's planning something bigger
in alliance with Nan Heng.

28:55.480 --> 28:57.270
These are all your speculations,

28:57.270 --> 28:58.730
aren't they, General Chu?

29:01.360 --> 29:03.660
But Mr. Li once saved my life.

29:06.880 --> 29:08.700
It felt like

29:08.750 --> 29:10.720
you were walking in a long,

29:10.720 --> 29:12.790
pitch-dark tunnel,

29:12.960 --> 29:15.310
and suddenly someone shone a light on you,

29:15.330 --> 29:17.030
telling you there's still hope
for everything,

29:17.030 --> 29:18.920
reassuring you not to lose heart.

29:19.000 --> 29:19.950
So,

29:20.160 --> 29:22.070
why can't we trust him?

29:25.390 --> 29:26.400
I know

29:26.550 --> 29:28.550
you're worried that I might get tricked.

29:28.550 --> 29:29.240
But

29:29.240 --> 29:31.550
even if there's only a
one-in-a-million chance now,

29:31.550 --> 29:33.000
I still have to try.

29:33.200 --> 29:34.400
Because all the plot

29:34.400 --> 29:36.360
revolves around Nan Heng.

29:36.440 --> 29:37.750
If we don't break it,

29:37.750 --> 29:39.480
both of us will lose our lives.

29:39.480 --> 29:40.760
Do you understand?

29:40.780 --> 29:42.310
Both of us losing our lives?

29:42.970 --> 29:45.370
You mean on the day of the
Lantern Festival?

29:47.510 --> 29:48.310
Yimeng.

29:48.590 --> 29:49.400
Don't worry.

29:49.720 --> 29:51.320
No matter what happens next,

29:51.750 --> 29:52.830
I will protect you.

29:52.830 --> 29:53.510
No, no.

29:53.510 --> 29:54.960
On that day, you should just

29:54.960 --> 29:56.310
patrol as usual.

29:56.510 --> 29:58.310
If the assassination succeeds,

29:59.060 --> 30:00.550
you and the Eighteenth Prince

30:00.550 --> 30:02.180
can reap the benefits.

30:02.310 --> 30:03.680
If it fails, it's okay too.

30:03.680 --> 30:05.030
You can just find any excuse

30:05.030 --> 30:06.000
and slack off a bit.

30:06.000 --> 30:06.880
Yimeng.

30:07.270 --> 30:09.600
What I'm worried about now isn't myself
at all,

30:09.600 --> 30:10.680
but you.

30:16.630 --> 30:17.430
I understand.

30:18.080 --> 30:19.130
I understand.

30:19.610 --> 30:21.070
You're the second male lead, after all.

30:21.070 --> 30:22.800
You'll always stand by my side.

30:23.440 --> 30:25.090
But please trust me.

30:27.200 --> 30:28.600
I have an ace up my sleeve.

30:28.710 --> 30:30.080
Nan Heng can't touch me.

30:34.500 --> 30:35.450
Alright, alright.

30:35.450 --> 30:36.920
Loosen up a bit.

30:36.920 --> 30:39.020
As the second male lead, you should
act like one.

30:39.020 --> 30:40.620
Handsome, sweet,

30:40.640 --> 30:42.500
and having trust in the female lead.

30:42.500 --> 30:43.720
Alright, I'm going home now.

30:43.720 --> 30:44.000
Yimeng...

30:44.000 --> 30:44.640
Bye-bye.

30:58.030 --> 30:59.830
I feel so awful.

31:02.060 --> 31:02.910
My Lady.

31:06.140 --> 31:06.960
Mother.

31:07.640 --> 31:08.440
Mother.

31:08.510 --> 31:09.770
What's wrong with you?

31:10.270 --> 31:11.230
I might

31:11.510 --> 31:14.600
not have much time left this time.

31:14.960 --> 31:15.880
Yiting.

31:16.550 --> 31:17.350
Can I

31:17.350 --> 31:18.410
see you get married

31:18.440 --> 31:19.920
before I

31:19.960 --> 31:21.480
close my eyes forever?

31:21.790 --> 31:24.240
That's the only wish I have left.

31:25.000 --> 31:25.790
Mother.

31:29.510 --> 31:30.310
Father

31:30.350 --> 31:32.410
has been fooled by this trick of yours

31:32.420 --> 31:34.020
for over 20 years, hasn't he?

31:35.000 --> 31:35.830
So clumsy

31:35.830 --> 31:37.230
as to be a laughingstock!

31:38.550 --> 31:40.010
Don't you dare take a step!

31:41.110 --> 31:42.200
Oh, why is my life

31:42.200 --> 31:44.000
so miserable?

31:44.160 --> 31:46.400
The daughter I carried for 10 months

31:46.400 --> 31:48.960
is even colder than ice.

31:50.590 --> 31:52.110
Let me die!

31:52.200 --> 31:53.350
Let me just die!

31:53.440 --> 31:54.880
-Madam, please don't!
-Please don't, Madam!

31:54.880 --> 31:56.270
Let me die!

31:56.310 --> 31:57.440
Madam, please don't!

31:57.440 --> 31:59.480
Don't stop me!

31:59.880 --> 32:00.680
If you really do this,

32:00.680 --> 32:02.380
Her Ladyship will lose her mother.

32:02.380 --> 32:03.400
Madam, she's turned around.

32:03.400 --> 32:05.030
She's turned around.

32:05.400 --> 32:06.600
She's turned around.

32:10.420 --> 32:13.300
I knew you cared about me.

32:13.440 --> 32:15.030
I've found it out for you.

32:15.070 --> 32:16.310
On the Lantern Festival,

32:16.310 --> 32:18.200
the Eighteenth Prince will
represent His Majesty

32:18.200 --> 32:19.720
to watch the lanterns from
the Imperial Tower.

32:19.720 --> 32:23.350
This is a once-in-a-lifetime opportunity.

32:23.400 --> 32:24.600
The Lantern Festival

32:24.680 --> 32:26.200
is to pray for blessings for
the Great Jing.

32:26.200 --> 32:27.660
It's not for matchmaking.

32:28.550 --> 32:29.310
I

32:29.310 --> 32:32.040
don't care at all about the fate
of the Great Jing.

32:32.040 --> 32:33.400
As long as you can get married,

32:33.400 --> 32:35.640
that would be my blessing.

32:36.750 --> 32:39.350
Mother, there's no need to
waste your efforts.

32:39.480 --> 32:41.480
In the noble families of this world,

32:41.590 --> 32:43.590
there are plenty of men with numerous
wives and concubines,

32:43.590 --> 32:45.000
while women helplessly comply

32:45.000 --> 32:47.720
and engage in the sordid business of
vying for beauty and favor.

32:47.720 --> 32:49.580
But I don't want to live like that.

32:51.030 --> 32:52.140
If I can meet

32:52.750 --> 32:54.410
a kindred spirit in this life,

32:54.630 --> 32:56.160
we might enjoy the
beautiful sceneries together

32:56.160 --> 32:57.420
and live a poetic life.

32:58.720 --> 33:00.590
But if there's no kindred spirit
to accompany me,

33:00.590 --> 33:02.400
I can enjoy life on my own.

33:02.630 --> 33:03.880
Why would I need a man?

33:20.350 --> 33:21.920
The Lantern Festival

33:22.000 --> 33:23.360
starts now!

33:41.070 --> 33:41.790
Are you alright?

33:41.790 --> 33:43.440
I'm okay. Thank you, sir.

33:46.640 --> 33:47.790
Everyone, stay alert.

33:47.790 --> 33:48.830
Don't be careless.

33:48.830 --> 33:51.240
Tonight, the Eighteenth Prince is here to
watch the lanterns on behalf of His Majesty.

33:51.240 --> 33:52.640
No mistake is allowed.

33:52.790 --> 33:53.590
Yes, Sir!

33:55.350 --> 33:56.160
Gentlemen.

33:56.160 --> 33:57.640
-Your Highness.
-Long time no see.

33:57.640 --> 33:59.640
I'd like to offer a toast to you both.

34:00.160 --> 34:01.340
Cheers.

34:07.920 --> 34:08.960
What time is it?

34:10.550 --> 34:12.830
It's now exactly 8 PM.

34:15.530 --> 34:17.469
We agreed to take action at 7 PM,

34:17.840 --> 34:19.360
yet there's still no sign of them.

34:19.360 --> 34:20.900
With how these two are dawdling,

34:20.900 --> 34:22.420
they think they can assassinate me?

34:22.420 --> 34:23.500
What a joke.

34:25.630 --> 34:27.710
You've asked this several times tonight.

34:27.710 --> 34:30.310
Why are you in such a hurry to
get assassinated?

34:36.949 --> 34:37.980
Impressive!

34:41.320 --> 34:42.110
Your Highness,

34:42.110 --> 34:42.880
they're here.

34:42.880 --> 34:43.909
The walking bouquet has arrived.

34:43.909 --> 34:45.170
What walking bouquet?

34:49.870 --> 34:51.440
Excuse me, coming through.

34:51.440 --> 34:52.280
Excuse me.

34:52.840 --> 34:54.710
The evening rush hour in ancient times

34:54.710 --> 34:56.020
is also quite a nightmare too.

34:56.020 --> 34:57.280
Please, please make way.

34:57.280 --> 34:58.190
Make way.

35:01.290 --> 35:03.230
Coming through, excuse me.

35:06.190 --> 35:07.050
Hurry, hurry.

35:10.970 --> 35:12.460
Sorry, sorry.

35:12.550 --> 35:13.460
I apologize, I apologize.

35:13.460 --> 35:14.540
It's you.

35:15.000 --> 35:16.320
You did that on purpose, didn't you?

35:16.320 --> 35:18.070
Dressed up like a walking bouquet,

35:18.070 --> 35:19.770
are you rushing to get married?

35:19.770 --> 35:21.880
Do you know how expensive this fabric is?

35:21.880 --> 35:23.360
You've even dirtied my clothes.

35:23.360 --> 35:24.230
I'm so sorry, I'm so sorry.

35:24.230 --> 35:25.070
I lost my balance

35:25.070 --> 35:25.880
and fell into you.

35:25.880 --> 35:27.230
I can't chat now. I'm in a hurry to
find someone.

35:27.230 --> 35:27.840
Stop right there.

35:27.840 --> 35:29.510
You think a simple "sorry" will suffice?

35:29.510 --> 35:30.670
Compensate me for my dress.

35:30.670 --> 35:31.190
You...

35:31.190 --> 35:32.050
Ruru.

35:32.110 --> 35:34.440
There are many people here.
Don't make a scene.

35:34.440 --> 35:35.640
I'm trying to help you.

35:35.640 --> 35:37.190
She's all dolled up.

35:37.190 --> 35:38.650
Who knows what she's up to?

35:44.290 --> 35:45.890
What do you want from me?

35:47.850 --> 35:49.070
I'll take this as compensation.

35:49.070 --> 35:49.760
Not this one.

35:49.760 --> 35:51.000
Can I give you something else instead?

35:51.000 --> 35:51.630
It has to be this one.

35:51.630 --> 35:53.070
This really won't do, sis.

35:53.070 --> 35:54.360
Give it back to me. This really won't do.

35:54.360 --> 35:55.490
It has to be this one.

36:07.250 --> 36:08.670
There's an assassin!

36:08.670 --> 36:09.150
Jixiang!

36:09.150 --> 36:10.610
Quick, quick, protect me!

36:15.000 --> 36:15.840
I'm done for.

36:21.070 --> 36:21.930
Your Highness.

36:22.030 --> 36:23.230
The plan has changed.

36:23.400 --> 36:24.600
What should we do now?

36:30.590 --> 36:31.440
Don't. Don't.

36:31.440 --> 36:32.300
Your Highness.

36:32.360 --> 36:33.160
The assassin.

36:33.980 --> 36:35.060
Your Highness.

36:35.150 --> 36:36.230
You... Listen to me.

36:36.230 --> 36:37.360
I'm not an assassin.

36:37.480 --> 36:38.710
This is just an

36:39.510 --> 36:40.890
ordinary hairpin.

36:41.400 --> 36:42.590
Really, trust me.

36:42.610 --> 36:44.470
This is just a misunderstanding.

36:45.710 --> 36:46.750
Misunderstanding?

36:46.750 --> 36:47.230
You're so...

36:47.230 --> 36:49.030
What's with all this commotion?

37:01.050 --> 37:02.070
This is a royal ceremony.

37:02.070 --> 37:03.710
So many eyes are watching.

37:03.770 --> 37:05.190
Making such a fuss over a small matter,

37:05.190 --> 37:06.320
how inappropriate.

37:06.750 --> 37:07.710
Aren't you ashamed?

37:07.710 --> 37:09.500
Heng, don't throw accusations around.

37:09.500 --> 37:10.480
What did I say?

37:10.480 --> 37:11.670
I just wanted to ask Miss Song...

37:11.670 --> 37:12.840
What's there to ask?

37:14.060 --> 37:15.030
Was all your studying for nothing?

37:15.030 --> 37:16.760
You only know to ask questions when
faced with a situation.

37:16.760 --> 37:17.960
I'm not criticizing you,

37:17.960 --> 37:19.710
but even rats have skin.

37:20.190 --> 37:21.920
Be more cautious in the future.

37:22.730 --> 37:23.330
I...

37:24.030 --> 37:24.840
You,

37:26.010 --> 37:26.930
come with me.

37:35.070 --> 37:36.960
I'm the chosen one!

37:37.110 --> 37:38.590
I'm the son of auspiciousness!

37:38.590 --> 37:40.190
I... What's wrong with me asking?

37:40.190 --> 37:41.920
I can't even ask questions now?

37:44.450 --> 37:46.080
What did that flowery sentence mean?

37:46.080 --> 37:46.710
The "mice"

37:46.710 --> 37:47.770
or "rats," he said?

37:47.880 --> 37:49.610
He was insulting me, wasn't he?

37:50.680 --> 37:52.280
I'm the victim!

38:01.630 --> 38:04.110
How should I get him to the riverside?

38:04.690 --> 38:06.090
If I just say it directly,

38:06.170 --> 38:07.770
wouldn't that be too abrupt?

38:08.000 --> 38:09.710
There's already been an unexpected
plot twist.

38:09.710 --> 38:10.590
And this guy

38:10.590 --> 38:12.030
is both cunning and slyly wicked.

38:12.030 --> 38:14.140
It would be bad if he sees through it.

38:14.320 --> 38:16.450
I've already stepped in to defend
her just now.

38:16.450 --> 38:18.860
This action was indeed too obvious.

38:19.470 --> 38:20.510
Next,

38:20.710 --> 38:23.540
I must not show any sign of
prior knowledge.

38:23.710 --> 38:24.920
I must find a way

38:24.940 --> 38:27.470
to make her lead me to the Jade River
on her own.

38:27.630 --> 38:28.800
Lanterns for sale!

38:29.430 --> 38:31.470
Lanterns, beautiful lanterns!

38:35.800 --> 38:38.040
How should I bring it up?

38:39.330 --> 38:40.510
Sugar figurines!

38:40.710 --> 38:42.110
Blown sugar figurines!

38:42.110 --> 38:42.880
Come and take a look!

38:42.880 --> 38:44.070
If we keep walking,

38:44.190 --> 38:45.520
we'll be out of the city.

38:49.150 --> 38:50.810
You've been quiet for a while.

38:51.190 --> 38:52.790
What are you thinking about?

38:54.110 --> 38:55.110
I...

38:55.660 --> 38:56.960
Of course I'm thinking about

38:56.960 --> 38:58.920
Your Highness's heroic figure when you
saved me just now.

38:58.920 --> 39:00.550
You were just like

39:00.580 --> 39:01.870
a god descending from heaven,

39:01.870 --> 39:02.930
incredibly brave,

39:02.960 --> 39:04.840
rescuing me from dire peril.

39:06.110 --> 39:06.880
Hey, Song Yimeng,

39:06.880 --> 39:09.080
since when did you become so talkative?

39:10.630 --> 39:13.430
If you have something to say,
just say it directly.

39:16.880 --> 39:19.080
Since Your Highness is so eager to know,

39:20.650 --> 39:22.360
I do have something to say.

39:22.360 --> 39:23.070
Then you...

39:24.320 --> 39:25.650
Then go ahead and say it.

39:26.880 --> 39:27.820
Your Highness.

39:30.760 --> 39:31.630
Your Highness,

39:34.400 --> 39:35.380
you...

39:36.000 --> 39:37.590
Your Highness, your hairline

39:37.590 --> 39:39.000
seems to have receded a bit

39:39.000 --> 39:40.730
compared to when I last saw you.

39:42.110 --> 39:43.030
Hairline?

39:43.710 --> 39:44.630
Hairline.

39:45.170 --> 39:46.150
Young man,

39:47.070 --> 39:50.070
why don't you accompany your lady to
release a river lantern at the Jade River?

39:50.070 --> 39:51.820
Lanterns for sale!

39:56.710 --> 39:58.750
A classic soap opera assist.

40:07.920 --> 40:08.960
Two mandarin duck lanterns,

40:08.960 --> 40:10.690
two taels of silver, no change.

40:11.960 --> 40:13.320
What kind of lanterns are these?
So expensive.

40:13.320 --> 40:14.320
Two taels?

40:14.670 --> 40:17.960
They're mandarin duck lanterns,
with blessings for perfect couples.

40:17.960 --> 40:20.510
Even the Aladdin's magic lamp wouldn't
be that expensive, right?

40:20.510 --> 40:21.400
What's the matter?

40:21.400 --> 40:22.460
Feeling the pinch?

40:23.800 --> 40:24.960
Miss.

40:24.980 --> 40:27.480
I've been married for 40 years.

40:27.480 --> 40:28.960
If you're young

40:29.030 --> 40:30.670
and willing to spend money,

40:30.670 --> 40:32.430
good fortune will follow.

40:34.360 --> 40:36.000
Look at you, the dignified daughter
of a minister,

40:36.000 --> 40:36.930
being so stingy.

40:39.000 --> 40:39.800
Take them.

40:40.610 --> 40:41.810
I'll buy them for you.

40:58.890 --> 41:00.090
You don't have money?

41:01.190 --> 41:03.030
You, a man, can't even

41:03.190 --> 41:05.910
afford to pay two taels of silver?

41:07.880 --> 41:10.510
I've been selling lanterns for 60 years,

41:10.510 --> 41:13.610
and I've never seen anyone
as stingy as you.

41:15.360 --> 41:15.920
Hey, I...

41:15.920 --> 41:17.050
Give them back to me.

41:26.440 --> 41:28.840
[Big-eyed Fish Lantern]
[Small-eyed Fish Lantern]

41:35.030 --> 41:35.960
This one

41:35.980 --> 41:37.000
is for you.

41:37.020 --> 41:37.740
Here.

41:39.400 --> 41:40.620
Thank you, granny.

41:40.800 --> 41:41.760
Miss,

41:41.800 --> 41:42.940
when looking for a man,

41:42.940 --> 41:45.210
you must keep your eyes wide open.

41:47.360 --> 41:48.320
Don't worry.

41:49.550 --> 41:51.140
Look at this lantern,

41:51.400 --> 41:52.460
squinting its eyes.

41:52.460 --> 41:54.900
Doesn't it look like your stingy face?

41:55.000 --> 41:55.810
Hey, I...

41:55.880 --> 41:57.530
I'll give this to you for free.

41:57.530 --> 41:58.650
I wish you

41:58.680 --> 42:00.710
to keep being stingy!

42:01.440 --> 42:02.170
I'm off.

42:04.840 --> 42:06.230
Who are you calling stingy?

42:06.230 --> 42:07.710
Who are you calling small-eyed?

42:07.710 --> 42:08.480
Your Highness.

42:08.480 --> 42:09.710
She didn't mean you. Your eyes
aren't small.

42:09.710 --> 42:10.550
Let's go, Your Highness.

42:10.550 --> 42:11.630
If we don't release the lanterns soon,
it'll be too late.

42:11.630 --> 42:12.320
Quick, let's go.

42:12.320 --> 42:14.050
Let's go release the lanterns.

42:14.230 --> 42:15.480
Come here.

42:16.230 --> 42:18.290
Your eyes are small. Here, take this.

42:18.840 --> 42:20.030
Thank you, sir.

42:23.190 --> 42:24.360
It's so pretty.
